					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 1: READING FROM A COLLECTION\n\nIn this example we are demonstrating the Read node by reading a single color from a Linear node.\nThe Linear generates a collection of 10 colors.\nWe are reading a single color from that collection.\n\nTry moving the slider and reading through the colors.\nTry switching from no interpolation to linear interpolation."
					}
				},
