					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 2: READING A SEQUENCE\n\nHere we have another Linear with 10 colors.\nWe convert this to a Texture2Drgba and into the Crossfader.\nAt the bottom we take a Read and a Sequence node.\nThe Sequence node generates 5 indices for the Read node.\nBy setting the step to 2 only get even numbers and by changing the begin parameter to 1 we would get al uneven numbers.\nThis is a bit of a niche use case where Read is better than Span."
					}
				},
